<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
    Filled-in copy of ch.codebar.llmgateway-worker.plist for this machine. The
    template beside it keeps the placeholders; this one is ready to load:

        cp deploy/ch.codebar.llmgateway-worker.local.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ch.codebar.llmgateway-worker.plist
        launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/ch.codebar.llmgateway-worker.plist

    One worker, matching BACKLOG_WORKERS=1. That setting only feeds the queue
    estimate and starts nothing, so a second worker without bumping it would
    halve every ETA the dashboard shows.

    APP_ENV is deliberately absent. A real environment variable wins over .env,
    so setting it here would run the worker as production while the site runs
    as local.

    A vision or OCR call carries its image through this process as base64, and
    PHP's 128M default is not enough to hold one: the worker died mid-request
    inside Guzzle, and the job it was holding came back as "attempted too many
    times". Hence the two limits below, which have to stay in this order —

      -d memory_limit=1024M  the hard ceiling. Exceeding it is a fatal error
                             that kills the worker and fails the job.
      --memory=768           the soft one. Laravel checks it *between* jobs and
                             exits cleanly so launchd starts a fresh worker.

    The soft limit is deliberately the lower of the two: a worker that grew on
    a big image restarts itself before it can ever reach the fatal one. Raise
    both together, and keep the gap.

    After code changes: php artisan queue:restart
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>ch.codebar.llmgateway-worker</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/sebastian/Library/Application Support/Herd/bin/php</string>
        <string>-d</string>
        <string>memory_limit=1024M</string>
        <string>/Users/sebastian/Projects/llm-gateway.codebar/artisan</string>
        <string>queue:work</string>
        <string>--queue=default</string>
        <string>--tries=1</string>
        <string>--timeout=960</string>
        <string>--sleep=1</string>
        <string>--max-time=3600</string>
        <string>--memory=768</string>
    </array>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/sebastian/Projects/llm-gateway.codebar</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
    </dict>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/sebastian/Projects/llm-gateway.codebar/storage/logs/worker.out.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/sebastian/Projects/llm-gateway.codebar/storage/logs/worker.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
